WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.610
Big brother Yuto! Big brother Yuto!

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:05.650
Hm?

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.240
Let's play Super Miracle Man!

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.780
Super Miracle Man's uncle,
who saw his true identity,

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.700
is trying to make money
by writing a tell-all book about it!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.830
That guy's terrible.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.170
I liked patting my little brother on the head.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:29.130
He was innocent and friendly,
and made friends quickly.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.090
On the other hand,
I was the complete opposite.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.970
If my brother was always out front,
then I was always in the back...

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.560
I'm sure that's why...

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:48.360
What about big brother Yuto?
He's not coming with us?

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.530
He's going to live with Papa.

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:51.820
Come on, let's go.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.660
Big brother Yuto!

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:59.830
That's right. Because I am a failure
who can't smile properly,

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.750
Mama didn't need me.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.540
The one Mama needed
was my perfect little brother.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.690
All right, I'm smiling properly.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:31.820
I'm acting like a Yuto Akama
that anyone would like.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.820
In order to fool others,
I have to start with myself.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.870
I even have to fool myself.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.660
That's right.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.540
This is the apathetic...

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.160
Solitary Coup d'Etat!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.730
Eruna... Eruna...

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.230
Can you unzip this for me?

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.820
Y-Yes, right away!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.950
Don't rush. Do it slowly.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.820
R-Right!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:52.460
Oh, if I go any further, I'll be too embarrassed!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.220
My lady.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.310
Good morning.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.560
It's all right, you don't have to
force yourself to get up.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.190
I will prepare breakfast in case you're hungry.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.150
Ms. Kurumi, I'm hungry, too.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.490
What, this is breakfast?!
Am I being treated like a dog?

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.990
But that means I'm being
recognized as Seisa's pet, right?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.040
Aroo! I'm going to go play with Seisa, aroo!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:35.540
By the way, the cost of your food and lodging
is being deducted from your points.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.800
What?!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.720
Seisa, I'm going to work hard to train
for the rookie battle starting today!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.440
Tension max! Go!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:05:00.530
Tough luck, no regrets, see ya next week!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.570
I can't get my special attack to work at all.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.030
This is your real ability, ryui.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.080
You aren't able to use
your power to the fullest yet, ryui.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.830
Oh, Ichinomiya!

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.880
You're working hard, aren't you?
How's it going? Were you beat up?

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:20.800
It's not even a matter
of getting beat up anymore!

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:24.880
It's like I've lost sight of how
I'm supposed to fight in the first place.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:25.890
Even with all that,

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.810
you were still trying to take advantage
of the confusion and touch weird places, huh?

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:33.600
I can't win the rookie battle like this!
Which means I can't make my ideal club!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:38.020
Ah, I want to practice more! I want to touch!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:44.240
Oh yeah, what do you think of doing
a class for club battle beginners?

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.070
A class for beginners?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:51.700
Eruna's an interesting kid, and we'd be
coaching the first years from the drama club, too.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.290
Oh, great idea!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:54.910
It'll be good motivation.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.460
I think it'll be good, rowr!

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.330
Right?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.710
Hmm... Well, if it's just until the rookie battle...

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.470
Please allow me to take that class!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.220
Okay, it's decided!

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.390
Isn't that nice, Eruna?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.970
I look forward to working with you!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.310
What are you talking to, rowr?!

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:16.270
My coaching is brutal, rowr!
I'm relentless, rowr!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.560
Oh, this one's cute, too!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.360
Prepare yourself, rowr!

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:25.400
This has bothered me for a while,
but you're not bear-like at all, are you?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.450
Also, don't you think ending your
sentences with "rowr" is forcing it a little?

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.450
Oh no! Stop!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.330
Because her beloved Nyamirin
decided that she was a bear,

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.620
Kumano tries hard every day
to fit the bear character!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.920
I know it's a weird way to end my sentences!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.720
But this was the only way I could think of
to show my personality in the drama club!

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:49.840
You've stopped using the weird ending.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.850
There, there.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:55.390
Oh dear, looks like things'll get noisy.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.730
Um, Akama?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.650
Big brother Yuto!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.030
Asuhi!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:12.910
U-Um, sorry about yesterday.
I lost in such an embarrassing way...

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.750
It's fine.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.420
Well, please excuse me.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.590
Okay, I'm gonna take your measurements.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.010
I get to wear an animal costume, too?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:32.220
A lovely squirrel? A lone wolf,
since I'm not in a club?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.720
A gorilla maybe?

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.060
After-School Red, Yuto Akama!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.400
After-School Subsection Chief, Nyamirin!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.190
After-School Peace Officer, Kumano, rowr! Growl!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.740
After-School Makushita 2nd Division,
Tonkyun. My real name is—

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:53.990
After-School Private, Usamaru!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:58.460
After-School Konjac Noodles,
Eruna Ichinomiya! The six of us are—

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.460
The After-School Six!

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.960
I... I want to go home...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.720
Oh no, the evil syndicate
Dark Chaos Gang is on a rampage!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.340
After-School Six, move out, rowr!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.010
Yeah, Passionate Tornado Kick!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.440
Clip-clop, clip-clop!
Let's finish off the Dark Chaos Gang!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.560
Tension max!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.820
No, no, Ichinomiya. You have to do
your special attack properly.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:27.530
One more time!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:32.280
Yessir! Tension max!
Tension max! Tension max!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.450
Tension ma—

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.330
What's wrong, After-School Konjac Noodles, rowr?

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.960
I-I'm sorry... I-I'm done for...

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.960
Stupid Noodles! The six of us
together make the After-School Six.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.960
You can't just stop!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.300
The limited express train of
passionate youth won't wait for you!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.640
A-After-School Private...

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:59.140
Come, let us fight to the end, Konjac Noodles!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.270
Thank you, After-School Makushita
2nd Division... And fall.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.150
Come on, come on, stand up and do it again.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.110
This is fun!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.900
Let's see...

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.240
If they come at me like this, I do <i>this</i>!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.320
If they come from this way, I do <i>this</i>!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.990
Find the opponent's opening
and quickly do this—

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.000
You're so noisy that I can't sleep.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.750
Squeal! I'm being attacked from this side, too.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.210
What's that?

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.630
This is the script for the After-School Six.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:34.630
It's actually more like a strategy guide for the
rookie battle that Akama wrote for each of us.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.180
Thanks to everyone in the
drama club, I'm improving a lot!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:42.600
You can expect a lot from my first match.
I think you'll fall in love with me all over again!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:48.360
Oh, speaking of which—
What kind of attack is your Killing Art?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:59.030
During the practice match, it
happened so fast that I couldn't really tell.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.450
I don't want to talk about that.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.330
Huh? Okay. Then, what
color is your underwear...?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.920
I don't want to talk about that, either.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.920
Jeez, you're so shy, Seisa.

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.260
Sorry I'm late, rowr!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:23.520
In order for you to keep up your power,
I bought a ton of food, rowr!

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.850
Yay!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:29.940
Th-This is a stamina pork bowl, isn't it?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:34.610
Oh, Tonkyun, I'm sorry! Don't think about
how it'd be cannibalism or something...

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:39.240
Just because I was given a pig costume
and nickname doesn't mean I'm an actual pig.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.990
It won't be cannibalism.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.080
Okay...

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.120
But pigs are delicious.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.920
Also, if possible, please call me
by my real name. It's—

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:52.380
Yay, I'm so lucky! I got a ton of
red pickled ginger in my pork bowl!

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:54.420
Ryui, ryui.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.510
I can't eat pork, so you can have it.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.600
What, really?

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.430
Tonkyun, it's true after all?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.430
I just like salad more than meat.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.270
Gorina, I'll give you a piece of mine, too.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.480
Gori...

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.990
Oh, the After-School Six really is the best.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:20.110
But I'm the only one whose power
hasn't awakened yet. I feel so behind!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.950
Usamaru, what kind of
special attack would you want?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:26.950
One that fits a main character,
of course! For example—

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.580
One like Super Miracle Man's!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.840
Oh, I remember that!
I watched it when I was a kid!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.750
I did, too, rowr!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.590
Wasn't that catchphrase cool?

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:45.640
Protect the world with royalties
from the tell-all book!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.560
Super Miracle Man has arrived!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.360
What's wrong?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.160
Sorry, I remembered something I have to do...

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.160
Akama...?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.010
Thanks for waiting,
first-year ladies and gentlemen!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:26.350
It's time to reveal the tournament
brackets for the rookie battle!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:30.180
The MC will be me, president and
representative of the manga research club,

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.270
Shigure Ninomiya!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.940
Those girls need more information
about Shigure's true perverted nature...

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:45.700
Eruna! I've found you in the midst
of a few hundred million people!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.910
Oh, that's so embarrassing.
If there were a hole, I'd want to bury him!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.410
Then he'd die, ryui.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.040
Yoo-hoo, Konjac Noodles!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.540
It's the After-School Six!
Wait, where's Akama?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.210
He is absent today, apparently.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:04.510
Too bad! Since tomorrow's the rookie battle,
today is the After-School Six's last day.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.260
Yeah...

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.510
Oh, really?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.600
And now, we'll reveal the tournament brackets!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.430
It's about time.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.570
It's so far, I can't see!

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.440
You can see it on your device, too.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:27.580
My opponent is... K-Katai!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.040
Th-This...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.340
I feel like things'll get
more and more interesting!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:43.340
Like it or not, this is the end.
After-School Six, let's review everything today!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.340
Yeah!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:48.220
Yuto... I wonder if he's lost...

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:59.110
It's unusual for you to show your face at school.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.900
It's unusual to see you by yourself.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.280
I was just trying to work out
a plan for my acting.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.070
What kind of role is it?

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.740
It's a tough one.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.960
He's loved by everyone, needed by everyone.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.960
That's what he wants for himself, too.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.290
But then one day,

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.590
a boy who takes after someone

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.340
who sees through his façade shows up.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:29.010
Every time he looks at him, he realizes...

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:35.100
...that he's just copying that innocent smile.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.400
It irritates him and makes him scared.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.060
He's afraid that the mask
will be peeled away someday,

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:43.230
and no one
will need him anymore.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:48.240
His memories of the past
are making him suffer.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:53.330
If it were me, I would deny that past.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.000
I would pretend it never happened.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.620
Pretend it never happened?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:02.340
The people I met then,
the scenes I saw... everything.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.520
Akama!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.440
What, you're still here?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:21.190
Yeah!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.690
Good work.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:26.650
After today, I guess the After-School Six
is disbanding to start something new.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.410
Thanks to that, the drama club will be
a little more peaceful starting tomorrow.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.870
I don't like stuff like goodbyes...

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:41.500
It's not a goodbye! Once I start my new club,
I'll bring my club members over!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.340
Then we'll be battling, got it?

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:49.130
There's just one thing I'd like you to tell me.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.380
Hm?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.470
You realized, didn't you, Ichinomiya?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.680
Huh?

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:02.860
Why didn't you say anything even though
you realized everything was just an act?

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.400
Why didn't you try to leave me?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:07.940
Just because...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.200
Just because I realized something like that
doesn't mean we're not friends anymore.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.410
What?

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:21.830
Besides, I think the other
club members all realized, too.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.630
We're back!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.300
A-Akama!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.470
Oh, it's Yuto!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:35.140
Welcome back! We thought we'd hold an
After-School Six disbanding ceremony.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.430
We bought a ton of stuff, rowr!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.430
What would you like to drink, Akama?

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.440
By the way, there's no pork miso soup.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.440
There's pork bone soup ramen, though.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:44.650
Wh—?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.150
Excuse me.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.580
What's wrong?

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.120
I didn't see that eejit anywhere,

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:05.170
so I wondered if she had
snuck into your room, my lady.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:16.390
Seisa! Sorry, I'll be spending the night
with the After-School Six in Akama's room.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.930
Wow, Tonkyun took off his mask!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.310
It's the first time I've seen it off!

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:23.350
What, handsome-Ton? Handsome-Ton, rowr!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:26.900
Oh, I'm sorry to leave you alone
so soon after moving in together.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:30.480
To keep you from being lonely,
I'll leave you with an Eruna kiss...

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.620
It looks like you will be able
to sleep peacefully tonight.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.530
Good night, my lady.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.130
Um, let's see...
Where will I be fighting...?

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.600
Oww...

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:03.680
Here.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.060
Th-Thanks!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.270
You know, you're a lot like my little brother.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.480
Huh?

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.280
Do your best.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.580
O-Okay!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.330
In the end, your Toy Gun is still unstable, ryui?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.880
It's okay. Even if I can't get
my special attack to work,

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.550
if I use everything I practiced with Akama
and the others from After-School Six,

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.170
I think I still have a chance of winning.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.640
I was surprised indeed.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:49.310
You are someone I aspire to be like,
but I also want to get revenge for Himi.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:55.860
I wanted to fight you someday, but I
didn't think my chance would come so soon.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.860
Let's make it a good fight.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.780
Yeah, Katai!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.120
Oh? You came all this way to watch. Curious?

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.460
No, not a bit.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.590
Begin the match.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.960
Isn't this fun, Katai?

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.420
Yes, it is!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:56.630
I wanted to win without
using this, but take <i>this</i>!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.840
Cutie Ink!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.690
All right! Tension's building up!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.540
It's no use waiting for me to run out of ammo!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.040
I'll decide things with this!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:45.220
Man, this is too much!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.960
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.420
Tension max!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:22.590
Go!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.720
Once more for kicks!

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.280
Winner, Eruna Ichinomiya.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:56.080
I lost, but I have no regrets.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.920
Please win the tournament, Ichinomiya.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:02.130
I will!

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:43.270
I can use Toy Gun again!

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.110
It's thanks to everyone in the drama club.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:47.650
The After-School Six are going to last forever!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.320
I'll keep training,
and next I'll learn how to use a real gun!

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.030
No real guns for you, ryui!

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:54.280
Fake guns, then?

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.580
That still comes across as criminal, ryui!

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.460
An ability like Fake Handgun?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.750
Don't make it fake, ryui!

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:01.500
It'll trick your eyes.

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:02.750
No tricking, ryui!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.500
The ability Fake Money?!

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.590
Stop it, this is getting dangerous, ryui!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.720
Let's just do the preview, ryui!

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:10.630
Next time, "School Fantasia."

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:12.930
The rookie battle rushes toward its climax.

00:24:13.140 --> 00:24:15.760
Could we see Usamaru's ability finally awaken?

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:19.060
I'll come up with one for him!
The ability Passionate Sweat!

00:24:19.270 --> 00:24:20.850
His sweat smells bad enough to break crystals!

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.400
That's a gross ability, ryui!
